469
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:16,280
So what are we doing here?

470
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:20,160
And Paul says very clearly

471
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:23,400
that this is part of it.

472
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:26,840
Part of the church revealing to the powers

473
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:29,340
and principalities the manifold wisdom of God

474
00:40:29,340 --> 00:40:32,500
is often Christians who have bowed the knee to Jesus,

475
00:40:32,500 --> 00:40:33,980
who refuse to compromise,

476
00:40:33,980 --> 00:40:37,180
actually find themselves persecuted for doing so.

477
00:40:38,060 --> 00:40:39,740
And if we go back to the picture,

478
00:40:39,740 --> 00:40:40,340
it really,

479
00:40:40,340 --> 00:40:41,360
it makes sense here

480
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:43,060
with the inaugurated and consummated.

481
00:40:43,060 --> 00:40:45,620
The kingdom of God has been inaugurated.

482
00:40:45,620 --> 00:40:48,200
Jesus has ascended.

483
00:40:48,200 --> 00:40:50,080
He is reigning and ruling.

484
00:40:50,080 --> 00:40:52,960
But while we still exist on this broken earth,

485
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,240
the powers and principalities

486
00:40:54,240 --> 00:40:56,480
will continue to do whatever they can

487
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:58,300
to get us to bow the knee

488
00:40:58,300 --> 00:40:59,800
to anything other than Jesus.

489
00:41:00,060 --> 00:41:07,680
I mean, this happens in our own political system, right?

490
00:41:07,680 --> 00:41:09,940
President gets elected when?

491
00:41:09,940 --> 00:41:13,160
November.

492
00:41:13,160 --> 00:41:16,640
I was like, am I, is this a trick?

493
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:17,560
I don't know, is this a trick?

494
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:19,620
The president gets elected November.

495
00:41:19,620 --> 00:41:20,720
When does he come into power?

496
00:41:20,720 --> 00:41:23,620
All right, there's a lot of shenanigans

497
00:41:23,620 --> 00:41:24,980
that both parties do

498
00:41:24,980 --> 00:41:26,400
when they are losing power

499
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,140
between November and January, all right?

500
00:41:28,140 --> 00:41:31,740
I'm not asking you to think about your verse.

501
00:41:31,740 --> 00:41:33,160
Both parties do it.

502
00:41:33,160 --> 00:41:37,980
And this is what is at work in the church now.

503
00:41:37,980 --> 00:41:40,400
Jesus has risen from the dead.

504
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,860
He has ascended to the throne.

505
00:41:41,860 --> 00:41:43,900
He is ruling and he is reigning.

506
00:41:43,900 --> 00:41:47,220
And he will return one day.

507
00:41:47,220 --> 00:41:51,820
Making all things new.

508
00:41:51,820 --> 00:41:54,920
Restoring all injustice.

509
00:41:54,920 --> 00:41:57,140
But between those times,

510
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:59,860
you better believe the powers and principalities

511
00:41:59,860 --> 00:42:01,040
will do whatever they can

512
00:42:01,040 --> 00:42:05,880
to keep the church from living into their vocation

513
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:08,100
as the working model of new creation on earth.

514
00:42:08,100 --> 00:42:18,160
Paul says, don't worry about me.

515
00:42:19,600 --> 00:42:22,540
I have bowed the knee to a risen Lord.

516
00:42:22,540 --> 00:42:25,360
Put me in prison.

517
00:42:25,360 --> 00:42:28,120
I'll convert your guards.

518
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:33,420
Right?

519
00:42:33,420 --> 00:42:34,760
Like, I don't, I'm fine.

520
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:35,640
This is fine.

521
00:42:35,640 --> 00:42:38,900
And again, to the American church,

522
00:42:38,900 --> 00:42:42,500
myself included, who loves being comfortable,

523
00:42:42,500 --> 00:42:47,320
who have been discipled our whole lives on consumerism,

524
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:52,580
may we be reminded that sometimes bowing the knee to Jesus

525
00:42:52,580 --> 00:42:55,380
and standing up for what is true in his kingdom

526
00:42:55,380 --> 00:42:59,160
doesn't result in us having a better earthly life.

527
00:43:00,220 --> 00:43:02,360
And if our goal is more comfort,

528
00:43:02,360 --> 00:43:05,780
a bigger Roth IRA,

529
00:43:05,780 --> 00:43:13,540
then bowing the knee to Jesus is not your strategy.

530
00:43:13,540 --> 00:43:21,680
But if your desire is to stand before God one day

531
00:43:21,680 --> 00:43:22,580
when he returns

532
00:43:22,580 --> 00:43:27,080
with crowns in your hands to lay at his feet,

533
00:43:27,080 --> 00:43:34,040
then earthly persecution, it's not easy.

534
00:43:34,040 --> 00:43:36,600
I'm not trying to make it trite and say,

535
00:43:36,600 --> 00:43:38,100
just get over it.

536
00:43:38,100 --> 00:43:40,020
No, it's hard.

537
00:43:40,020 --> 00:43:42,500
But it's the powers and principalities

538
00:43:42,500 --> 00:43:45,180
and their rule and reign is dwindling.

539
00:43:45,180 --> 00:43:49,100
And it's temporary.

540
00:43:50,040 --> 00:43:52,060
But the one who we've bowed the knee to

541
00:43:52,060 --> 00:43:53,780
his reign and rule is eternal.

542
00:43:53,780 --> 00:43:58,200
And everything that happens here on earth

543
00:43:58,200 --> 00:43:58,820
is but a vapor.

544
00:43:58,820 --> 00:44:06,080
Lastly, Paul is a good pastor.

545
00:44:06,080 --> 00:44:10,840
And he knows that everything that he just laid out

546
00:44:10,840 --> 00:44:11,880
in the first three chapters,

547
00:44:11,880 --> 00:44:13,920
primarily getting Jews and Gentiles

548
00:44:13,920 --> 00:44:16,000
to play nicely with one another in one room,

549
00:44:16,000 --> 00:44:17,320
it's going to be very hard.

550
00:44:19,580 --> 00:44:21,200
Just like I, as a pastor,

551
00:44:21,200 --> 00:44:23,620
know that us in this room,

552
00:44:23,620 --> 00:44:25,580
getting all of us to play nicely

553
00:44:25,580 --> 00:44:28,200
with our different temporary identity markers

554
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:31,160
and political allegiances

555
00:44:31,160 --> 00:44:32,660
and cultural whatevers,

556
00:44:32,660 --> 00:44:34,980
it's going to be hard.

557
00:44:34,980 --> 00:44:38,120
And so Paul ends this section with a prayer.

558
00:44:38,120 --> 00:44:40,140
He says,

559
00:44:40,200 --> 00:44:57,840
And I pray that you,

560
00:44:57,840 --> 00:45:00,780
so that Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith.

561
00:45:01,220 --> 00:45:02,800
And I pray that you,

562
00:45:02,800 --> 00:45:06,100
the church being rooted and established in love,

563
00:45:06,100 --> 00:45:09,840
may have power together with all the Lord's people

564
00:45:09,840 --> 00:45:13,840
to grasp how wide and how long and how high

565
00:45:13,840 --> 00:45:15,620
and how deep is the love of Christ.

566
00:45:15,620 --> 00:45:22,320
And to know this love that surpasses knowledge,

567
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:26,840
that you may be filled to the measure of the fullness of God.

568
00:45:26,840 --> 00:45:32,480
Now to Him who is able to do immeasurably more

569
00:45:32,480 --> 00:45:35,040
than all we ask or imagine,

570
00:45:35,040 --> 00:45:38,220
according to His power that is at work within us,

571
00:45:38,220 --> 00:45:40,540
to Him be the glory in the church

572
00:45:40,540 --> 00:45:43,640
and in Christ Jesus throughout all generations,

573
00:45:43,640 --> 00:45:45,680
forever and ever.

574
00:45:47,060 --> 00:45:53,140
This problem is at least 2,000 years old.

575
00:45:53,140 --> 00:45:56,420
Paul knows that it will be a difficult task

576
00:45:56,420 --> 00:45:58,480
to get sinful people from every tribe,

577
00:45:58,480 --> 00:45:59,660
language and culture

578
00:45:59,660 --> 00:46:03,020
who have spent their entire lives being deceived

579
00:46:03,020 --> 00:46:04,780
and manipulated by the powers

580
00:46:04,780 --> 00:46:06,860
to walk in a new identity

581
00:46:06,860 --> 00:46:09,260
and to work towards a new vocation.

582
00:46:09,260 --> 00:46:11,780
And so he stops,

583
00:46:11,780 --> 00:46:14,320
he stops writing Scripture.

584
00:46:15,400 --> 00:46:16,600
He's writing Scripture

585
00:46:16,600 --> 00:46:19,160
and he stops and gets on his knees

586
00:46:19,160 --> 00:46:21,100
to pray for the church.

587
00:46:21,100 --> 00:46:26,740
And he prays that the God who raised Jesus from the dead

588
00:46:26,740 --> 00:46:29,820
will fill us, the church, with the Holy Spirit

589
00:46:29,820 --> 00:46:33,000
and He will empower us to do something

590
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:35,880
beyond what we could ever envision on our own.

591
00:46:35,880 --> 00:46:40,240
And rather than me trying to exegete a prayer in Scripture,

592
00:46:40,240 --> 00:46:43,400
I just wanted to dedicate the rest of our time

593
00:46:43,400 --> 00:46:45,360
to pray for the church.

594
00:46:45,360 --> 00:46:48,300
For all of us

595
00:46:48,300 --> 00:46:50,680
to just quiet ourselves before the Lord.

596
00:46:50,680 --> 00:46:52,900
If you feel comfortable, get on your knees.

597
00:46:52,900 --> 00:46:54,220
If you're able physically,

598
00:46:54,220 --> 00:46:55,840
if you can't, no pressure.

599
00:46:55,840 --> 00:47:01,500
I just want to spend a few minutes here at the end

600
00:47:01,500 --> 00:47:04,820
praying

601
00:47:04,820 --> 00:47:07,560
that the God

602
00:47:07,560 --> 00:47:10,320
who is able to do exceedingly abundantly

603
00:47:10,320 --> 00:47:12,040
more than we ask, think, or imagine

604
00:47:12,040 --> 00:47:15,100
would empower us to become a people

605
00:47:15,100 --> 00:47:17,700
who demonstrate the manifold wisdoms of God

606
00:47:17,700 --> 00:47:19,480
to the powers and principalities of this air.

607
00:47:19,480 --> 00:47:23,640
Because we will not be able to do it on our own.

608
00:47:23,640 --> 00:47:28,260
And I know that all of us at times

609
00:47:28,260 --> 00:47:30,140
will be lured back into the world

610
00:47:30,140 --> 00:47:31,140
by the lies of the enemy.

611
00:47:33,220 --> 00:47:35,860
But I have seen in this group of people,

612
00:47:35,860 --> 00:47:39,540
I have seen in your hearts,

613
00:47:39,540 --> 00:47:42,160
I have seen in your actions,

614
00:47:42,160 --> 00:47:44,300
a receptiveness

615
00:47:44,300 --> 00:47:46,060
to repent

616
00:47:46,060 --> 00:47:47,300
and to do the things

617
00:47:47,300 --> 00:47:48,720
that God is inviting you to do.

618
00:47:48,720 --> 00:47:51,340
I am so filled with hope for our church.

619
00:47:51,340 --> 00:47:54,780
I am so filled with hope for the church

620
00:47:54,780 --> 00:47:57,120
because we have been indwelt

621
00:47:57,120 --> 00:47:58,100
by the Holy Spirit

622
00:47:58,100 --> 00:48:00,540
who is able to do exceedingly abundantly

623
00:48:00,540 --> 00:48:02,000
more than we ask, think, or imagine.

624
00:48:02,000 --> 00:48:03,320
And if we look around

625
00:48:03,320 --> 00:48:05,480
at the scope of the church in America

626
00:48:05,480 --> 00:48:06,380
and across the world,

627
00:48:06,380 --> 00:48:08,420
we might be tempted to think

628
00:48:08,420 --> 00:48:09,360
how in the world

629
00:48:09,360 --> 00:48:10,640
are we ever gonna figure out

630
00:48:10,640 --> 00:48:11,360
how to live together?

631
00:48:11,360 --> 00:48:12,960
How are we gonna be

632
00:48:12,960 --> 00:48:15,640
the present embodiment

633
00:48:15,640 --> 00:48:17,080
of new creation on earth?

634
00:48:17,080 --> 00:48:21,340
And I think Paul gives us the answer here.

635
00:48:21,340 --> 00:48:23,760
And the answer is prayer.

636
00:48:23,760 --> 00:48:27,380
We're not gonna be able to do it on our own.

637
00:48:27,380 --> 00:48:28,000
We're not gonna be able

638
00:48:28,000 --> 00:48:29,720
to muscle it through with willpower.

639
00:48:30,540 --> 00:48:35,760
I'm not gonna preach

640
00:48:35,760 --> 00:48:36,540
a good enough sermon

641
00:48:36,540 --> 00:48:38,780
to make us live into this reality.

642
00:48:38,780 --> 00:48:42,560
Tim Mackey's not gonna make

643
00:48:42,560 --> 00:48:43,980
a good enough video

644
00:48:43,980 --> 00:48:45,700
illustrating how this should happen

645
00:48:45,700 --> 00:48:46,520
for us to do it.

646
00:48:46,520 --> 00:48:48,300
We need the Holy Spirit.

647
00:48:48,300 --> 00:48:54,400
So I don't know

648
00:48:54,400 --> 00:48:55,660
how long we're gonna take,

649
00:48:55,660 --> 00:48:57,100
but let's just

650
00:48:57,100 --> 00:49:00,360
quiet ourselves before the Lord.

651
00:49:00,360 --> 00:49:01,880
Lord, I invite you

652
00:49:01,880 --> 00:49:03,640
wherever you're at

653
00:49:03,640 --> 00:49:04,340
to get comfortable

654
00:49:04,340 --> 00:49:05,880
in a posture of surrender.

655
00:49:05,880 --> 00:49:08,460
And let's just pray.

656
00:49:08,460 --> 00:49:11,980
Pray for us as individuals.

657
00:49:11,980 --> 00:49:14,220
Pray for us as this local church.

658
00:49:14,220 --> 00:49:16,420
And pray for the church

659
00:49:16,420 --> 00:49:17,840
in America and across the world.

660
00:49:17,840 --> 00:49:19,180
And what I want us to pray for

661
00:49:19,180 --> 00:49:21,140
is that we would be a people

662
00:49:21,140 --> 00:49:24,440
who demonstrate the powers

663
00:49:24,440 --> 00:49:25,360
and principalities,

664
00:49:25,360 --> 00:49:27,020
the manifold wisdom of God.

665
00:49:27,020 --> 00:49:29,480
We'll pray for a while

666
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:30,860
and then I'll close this out.

667
00:49:30,860 --> 00:49:33,240
pray for us as this local church.

668
00:49:33,240 --> 00:49:36,180
And let's pray for us as this local church.

669
00:49:36,180 --> 00:49:36,960
And let's pray for us as this local church.

670
00:49:36,960 --> 00:49:37,560
And let's pray for us as this local church.

671
00:54:29,660 --> 00:54:43,360
To him who is able to do exceedingly abundantly.

672
00:54:43,360 --> 00:54:45,360
More than we ask, think, or imagine.

673
00:54:45,360 --> 00:54:55,360
Fill us with your Holy Spirit.

674
00:54:55,360 --> 00:55:00,360
God, I pray for every individual in the room who has bowed the knee to Jesus.

675
00:55:00,360 --> 00:55:09,060
God, I pray that you would concrete in their souls their new primary identity.

676
00:55:09,060 --> 00:55:16,060
As a little Christ, follower of Jesus.

677
00:55:16,060 --> 00:55:19,060
Adopted into the family of God.

678
00:55:19,060 --> 00:55:26,760
God, make us aware of the temporary identity markers.

679
00:55:26,760 --> 00:55:29,760
Whether ethnic or cultural.

680
00:55:29,760 --> 00:55:33,760
Whatever political, religious.

681
00:55:33,760 --> 00:55:39,360
Whatever identity markers we are putting above the name of Jesus in our lives.

682
00:55:39,360 --> 00:55:40,760
God, make us aware of it.

683
00:55:40,760 --> 00:55:50,460
Convict us when we find ourselves celebrating someone other, some image bearer of God.

684
00:55:50,460 --> 00:55:54,460
In pain for the sake of our tribe winning.

685
00:55:54,460 --> 00:56:08,160
And equip us to work towards life and flourishing for every image bearer.

686
00:56:08,160 --> 00:56:15,160
God, may we be the working model of new creation on earth as it is in heaven until you return.

687
00:56:15,160 --> 00:56:23,860
God, and we pray that you would not be slow in returning.

688
00:56:23,860 --> 00:56:25,860
There is so much injustice in the world.

689
00:56:25,860 --> 00:56:26,860
So much evil.

690
00:56:26,860 --> 00:56:35,860
So much idol worship that is killing us.

691
00:56:35,860 --> 00:56:37,860
God, we need you.

692
00:56:37,860 --> 00:56:45,560
Maranatha come Lord quickly.

693
00:56:45,560 --> 00:56:49,560
For every person in here who has not yet bowed the knee to Jesus.

694
00:56:49,560 --> 00:57:00,560
God, I pray that in Ephesians 1 through 3, they see the beautiful redemptive work of the death, burial, resurrection, and ascension of Jesus.

695
00:57:00,560 --> 00:57:08,260
God, that they would realize there is an eternal kingdom that is worth living for now.

696
00:57:08,260 --> 00:57:16,260
That it gives purpose, it gives hope, and it gives peace in a chaotic world.

697
00:57:16,260 --> 00:57:25,260
God, if there's anybody that has not yet trusted in you this morning, may today be the day that they say, "I'm done being lied to by the powers and principalities.

698
00:57:25,260 --> 00:57:28,960
I'm done bowing my knees to idols.

699
00:57:28,960 --> 00:57:32,960
I am going to bow my knee to the name above every other name.

700
00:57:32,960 --> 00:57:38,960
The one who created all things both in heaven and on earth."

701
00:57:38,960 --> 00:57:46,960
And God, for your church in America and across the world.

702
00:57:46,960 --> 00:58:10,660
God, for where we allow secondary theology and our voting records to keep us out of fellowship with our brothers and sisters in Christ, unite us.

703
00:58:10,660 --> 00:58:18,360
God, may we bring our culture, may we bring our perspectives, may we bring our temporary identity markers to the table,

704
00:58:18,360 --> 00:58:24,360
but do so in a way that surrenders all of them to our primary allegiance, which is you.

705
00:58:24,360 --> 00:58:28,360
And ultimately, God, I pray,

706
00:58:28,360 --> 00:58:36,060
the powers and principalities, the rulers of this world,

707
00:58:36,060 --> 00:58:41,060
the enemy would see

708
00:58:41,060 --> 00:58:45,060
that their defeat

709
00:58:45,060 --> 00:58:48,060
has been inaugurated and will be consummated.

710
00:58:48,060 --> 00:58:54,060
May we demonstrate to them the manifold wisdom of your gospel.

711
00:58:54,060 --> 00:59:05,760
And we push back the darkness by shining a light.

712
00:59:05,760 --> 00:59:07,760
They bruised your heel.

713
00:59:07,760 --> 00:59:10,760
You crushed their head.

714
00:59:10,760 --> 00:59:13,760
May we live in that victory

715
00:59:13,760 --> 00:59:15,760
every day

716
00:59:15,760 --> 00:59:20,760
for your glory, for our good, and for the good of our neighbors.

717
00:59:20,760 --> 00:59:23,460
In Jesus' name I pray.

718
00:59:23,460 --> 00:59:26,460
Amen.

719
00:59:26,460 --> 00:59:34,460
I'm just gonna, as we dismiss, just ask that we keep the auditorium a bit quiet and reflective

720
00:59:34,460 --> 00:59:36,460
for those of us that want to continue to pray.

721
00:59:36,460 --> 00:59:38,460
If you're in here and you don't have a relationship with Jesus,

722
00:59:38,460 --> 00:59:40,960
you want to talk to somebody about that,

723
00:59:40,960 --> 00:59:44,960
there will be some of us up here at our prayer booth.

724
00:59:44,960 --> 00:59:48,760
I've been told I can't call it a tent because it doesn't have a roof.

725
00:59:48,760 --> 00:59:51,460
So it is our prayer booth.

726
00:59:51,460 --> 00:59:53,460
Um, let's keep it chill in here.

727
00:59:53,460 --> 00:59:54,460
I know we love to fellowship.

728
00:59:54,460 --> 00:59:55,960
Fellowship is not ungodly.

729
00:59:55,960 --> 00:59:57,260
It is actually very godly.

730
00:59:57,260 --> 00:59:59,060
So if the Lord is leading you to fellowship,

731
00:59:59,060 --> 01:00:01,960
do it in that area or in that area.

732
01:00:01,960 --> 01:00:04,760
Um, but let's keep it chill in here for,

733
01:00:04,760 --> 01:00:08,760
for just a little bit so we can spend some time praying if we want to continue to do so.

734
01:00:08,760 --> 01:00:12,760
Um, other than that, go in peace, church.

735
01:00:12,760 --> 01:00:13,760
Love you.

736
01:00:13,760 --> 01:00:14,760
Amen.

737
01:00:43,760 --> 01:00:44,760
Amen.

738
